---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms of use | HotelsViewer"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the HotelsViewer website."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="small updated">Last updated: October 18, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose measure">
      <p>Welcome to HotelsViewer (hotelsviewer.com). By using this website, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>

      <h2>1. What HotelsViewer is</h2>
      <p>HotelsViewer is an informational website about hotel rooms that face landmarks. We don't sell stays, we don't take payments and we are not a travel agency. Every booking is made on the website of the booking site or hotel you choose.</p>

      <h2>2. Room names, views and availability</h2>
      <p>We copy room category names from hotel and booking websites and show the month of our last check. Hotels can rename categories, change which rooms they assign, and lose a view to construction or trees at any time. Always check the room category and the final price on the booking page before you pay. We are not responsible for differences between what is shown here and what a hotel provides.</p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Some links on HotelsViewer may be affiliate links. If you book through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. You can read more in our <a class="text-link" href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-party websites</h2>
      <p>Links on this site lead to websites we don't own or control. We are not responsible for their content, prices, policies or services. Your booking, and anything that follows from it, is between you and that website or hotel.</p>

      <h2>5. No warranty</h2>
      <p>The site and its content are provided “as is” and “as available”. We don't promise that the site will always be available or error-free, or that the information on it is complete or up to date.</p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent allowed by law, HotelsViewer and its owner are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the site, including bookings made through links on it or reliance on information shown here.</p>

      <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The design, text and original content of HotelsViewer belong to us. Hotel names and room category names belong to their owners and are quoted only to identify what to book. Photos are used under the licences credited next to them. Please don't copy our content in bulk or collect it with automated tools without our written permission.</p>

      <h2>8. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Please don't misuse the site: don't try to disrupt it, break its security, overload it with automated requests, or use it for anything unlawful.</p>

      <h2>9. Privacy</h2>
      <p>How we handle information about visitors is described in our <a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>10. Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they last changed. By continuing to use the site after an update, you accept the new terms.</p>

      <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the United States, without regard to conflict of law rules.</p>

      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Write to <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
